ssee/shelby-county"],["ARC or PLC in Shelby County","/arc-plc/tennessee/shelby-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and June to July came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 198% of normal in April to May and 42% of normal in November to December. Grid 18159 had its driest year in 1963, at 62% of normal.</p>"}
